#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reducing circuit depth with the AQC-Tensor Qiskit addon"
msgstr "Mengurangkan kedalaman Circuit dengan tambahan AQC-Tensor Qiskit"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/aqc-"
"tensor/01_initial_state_aqc.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/aqc-"
"tensor/01_initial_state_aqc.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this notebook, we will work through the steps of a [Qiskit "
"pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) while "
"using **approximate quantum compilation with tensor networks (AQC-Tensor)** "
"to achieve a lower circuit depth than would ordinarily be needed to perform "
"Trotter evolution.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam notebook ini, kita akan melalui langkah-langkah sebuah [corak "
"Qiskit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) sambil "
"menggunakan **pengkompilan kuantum hampiran dengan rangkaian tensor (AQC-"
"Tensor)** untuk mencapai kedalaman Circuit yang lebih rendah berbanding yang"
" biasanya diperlukan untuk melaksanakan evolusi Trotter.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "These are the steps that we will take:\n"
msgstr "Ini adalah langkah-langkah yang akan kita ambil:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1: Map to quantum problem**\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 1: Peta ke masalah kuantum**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Initialize our problem's Hamiltonian and observable(s)\n"
msgstr "Mulakan Hamiltonian masalah kita dan observable(s)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Generate a target tensor-network state for the initial"
" portion of the circuit</font>\n"
msgstr ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Jana keadaan rangkaian tensor sasaran untuk bahagian "
"awal Circuit</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Generate a low-depth circuit which approximates the "
"portion being compressed</font>\n"
msgstr ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Jana Circuit berkedalaman rendah yang menghampiri "
"bahagian yang dimampatkan</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Generate a general ansatz from that circuit</font>\n"
msgstr ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Jana ansatz umum daripada Circuit tersebut</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Optimize the parameters to bring the ansatz as close "
"as possible to the target</font>\n"
msgstr ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Optimumkan parameter untuk membawa ansatz sedekat "
"mungkin ke sasaran</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Add subsequent Trotter steps to the optimized "
"ansatz</font>\n"
msgstr ""
"<font color='#0F62FE'>Tambah langkah Trotter seterusnya ke ansatz yang telah"
" dioptimumkan</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2: Optimize for target hardware**\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 2: Optimumkan untuk perkakasan sasaran**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the circuit for hardware\n"
msgstr "Transpile Circuit untuk perkakasan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3: Execute experiments**\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 3: Jalankan eksperimen**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a fake backend for simplicity\n"
msgstr "Gunakan backend palsu untuk memudahkan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4: Reconstruct results**\n"
msgstr "**Langkah 4: Bina semula keputusan**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "N/A; instead, we just output the measured observable\n"
msgstr "T/B; sebaliknya, kita hanya keluarkan observable yang diukur\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 1: Map to quantum circuit and operator {#step-1-map-to-quantum-circuit-"
"and-operator}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 1: Peta ke Circuit kuantum dan operator {#step-1-map-to-quantum-"
"circuit-and-operator}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up a model Hamiltonian and observable {#set-up-a-model-hamiltonian-and-"
"observable}"
msgstr ""
"Sediakan Hamiltonian model dan observable {#set-up-a-model-hamiltonian-and-"
"observable}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this notebook, we use the Ising model on a circle of 10 sites:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\hat{\\mathcal{H}}_{\\text{Ising}} = \\sum_{i=1}^{10} J_{i,(i+1)} Z_i Z_{(i+1)} + h_i X_i \\, ,\n"
"$$\n"
"where the periodic boundary conditions imply that for $i=10$ we obtain $i+1=11\\rightarrow1$, $J$ is the coupling strength between two sites and $h$ is the external magnetic field.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam notebook ini, kita menggunakan model Ising pada bulatan 10 tapak:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\hat{\\mathcal{H}}_{\\text{Ising}} = \\sum_{i=1}^{10} J_{i,(i+1)} Z_i Z_{(i+1)} + h_i X_i \\, ,\n"
"$$\n"
"di mana syarat sempadan berkala bermakna untuk $i=10$ kita memperoleh $i+1=11\\rightarrow1$, $J$ adalah kekuatan gandingan antara dua tapak dan $h$ adalah medan magnet luaran.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The observable we will measure is the total magnetization.\n"
msgstr "Observable yang akan kita ukur adalah jumlah kemagnetan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Determine how much of the time evolution to simulate classically "
"{#determine-how-much-of-the-time-evolution-to-simulate-classically}"
msgstr ""
"Tentukan berapa banyak evolusi masa yang hendak disimulasi secara klasik "
"{#determine-how-much-of-the-time-evolution-to-simulate-classically}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Our overall goal is to simulate time evolution of the above model "
"Hamiltonian.  We do so by Trotter evolution, which we split into two "
"portions:\n"
msgstr ""
"Matlamat keseluruhan kita adalah untuk mensimulasi evolusi masa model "
"Hamiltonian di atas. Kita lakukan ini melalui evolusi Trotter, yang kita "
"bahagikan kepada dua bahagian:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An initial portion that is simulable with matrix product states (MPS).  We "
"will \"compile\" this portion using AQC as presented in "
"https://arxiv.org/abs/2301.08609.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bahagian awal yang boleh disimulasi dengan keadaan produk matriks (MPS). "
"Kita akan \"mengkompil\" bahagian ini menggunakan AQC seperti yang "
"dibentangkan dalam https://arxiv.org/abs/2301.08609.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. A subsequent portion of the circuit that will be executed on hardware.\n"
"Let's plan to use AQC-Tensor to compress our time evolution circuit up to time $t=4$, then evolve using ordinary Trotter steps up to $t=5$.\n"
msgstr ""
"2. Bahagian seterusnya dari Circuit yang akan dijalankan pada perkakasan.\n"
"Mari kita rancang untuk menggunakan AQC-Tensor bagi memampatkan Circuit evolusi masa kita sehingga masa $t=4$, kemudian berevolusi menggunakan langkah Trotter biasa sehingga $t=5$.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate circuits before and after split {#generate-circuits-before-and-"
"after-split}"
msgstr ""
"Jana Circuit sebelum dan selepas pemisahan {#generate-circuits-before-and-"
"after-split}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now that we have chosen to split at $t=4$, we will generate two circuits:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kini setelah kita memilih untuk membahagi pada $t=4$, kita akan menjana dua "
"Circuit:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A \"target\" circuit for the AQC portion of the evolution, from $t_i=0$ to "
"$t_f=4$.  Because this is being simulated by a tensor-network simulator, the"
" number of layers affects execution time only by a constant factor, so we "
"might as well use a generous number of layers to minimize Trotter error.\n"
msgstr ""
"Circuit \"sasaran\" untuk bahagian AQC evolusi, dari $t_i=0$ ke $t_f=4$. "
"Oleh kerana ini disimulasi oleh simulator rangkaian tensor, bilangan lapisan"
" hanya mempengaruhi masa pelaksanaan dengan faktor malar, jadi kita lebih "
"baik menggunakan bilangan lapisan yang banyak untuk meminimumkan ralat "
"Trotter.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A subsequent evolution circuit, which evolves from $t_i=4$ to $t_f=5$.  "
"Because this is being run on quantum hardware, it is desirable to use as few"
" Trotter layers as possible.\n"
msgstr ""
"Circuit evolusi seterusnya, yang berevolusi dari $t_i=4$ ke $t_f=5$. Oleh "
"kerana ini dijalankan pada perkakasan kuantum, adalah wajar untuk "
"menggunakan seberapa sedikit lapisan Trotter yang mungkin.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For the sake of later comparison, let's also generate a third circuit: one "
"that evolves for `aqc_evolution_time` but which has the same evolution time "
"per Trotter step as the subsequent circuit.  This is the circuit we would "
"have working with had we not used a generous number of Trotter steps for the"
" target circuit.  We will refer to this as the _comparison circuit_.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk tujuan perbandingan kemudian, mari kita juga jana Circuit ketiga: satu"
" yang berevolusi untuk `aqc_evolution_time` tetapi mempunyai masa evolusi "
"yang sama setiap langkah Trotter seperti Circuit seterusnya. Ini adalah "
"Circuit yang kita akan gunakan sekiranya kita tidak menggunakan bilangan "
"langkah Trotter yang banyak untuk Circuit sasaran. Kita akan menyebutnya "
"sebagai _Circuit perbandingan_.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generate an ansatz and initial parameters from a Trotter circuit with fewer "
"steps {#generate-an-ansatz-and-initial-parameters-from-a-trotter-circuit-"
"with-fewer-steps}"
msgstr ""
"Jana ansatz dan parameter awal daripada Circuit Trotter dengan langkah lebih"
" sedikit {#generate-an-ansatz-and-initial-parameters-from-a-trotter-circuit-"
"with-fewer-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"First, we construct a \"good\" circuit that has the same evolution time as "
"the target circuit, but with fewer Trotter steps (and thus fewer layers).\n"
msgstr ""
"Pertama, kita bina Circuit \"baik\" yang mempunyai masa evolusi yang sama "
"seperti Circuit sasaran, tetapi dengan langkah Trotter yang lebih sedikit "
"(dan dengan itu lapisan yang lebih sedikit).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then we pass this \"good\" circuit to AQC-Tensor's `generate_ansatz_from_circuit` function.  This function analyzes the two-qubit connectivity of the circuit and returns two things:\n"
"1. a general, parametrized ansatz circuit with the same two-qubit connectivity as the input circuit; and,\n"
"2. parameters that, when plugged into the ansatz, yield the input (good) circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kemudian kita hantar Circuit \"baik\" ini ke fungsi `generate_ansatz_from_circuit` AQC-Tensor. Fungsi ini menganalisis sambungan dua-Qubit Circuit dan mengembalikan dua perkara:\n"
"1. Circuit ansatz berparameter umum dengan sambungan dua-Qubit yang sama seperti Circuit input; dan,\n"
"2. parameter yang, apabila dimasukkan ke dalam ansatz, menghasilkan Circuit input (baik) tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Soon we will take these parameters and iteratively adjust them to bring the "
"ansatz circuit as close as possible to the target MPS.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tidak lama lagi kita akan mengambil parameter ini dan menyesuaikannya secara"
" berulang untuk membawa Circuit ansatz sedekat mungkin ke MPS sasaran.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/aqc-tensor/01-initial-state-"
"aqc/output_1.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Gambar rajah Circuit kuantum](/img/qiskit-addons/aqc-tensor/01-initial-"
"state-aqc/output_1.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Choose settings for tensor network simulation {#choose-settings-for-tensor-"
"network-simulation}"
msgstr ""
"Pilih tetapan untuk simulasi rangkaian tensor {#choose-settings-for-tensor-"
"network-simulation}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here, we use the tensor network simulator based on "
"[quimb](http://quimb.readthedocs.io/). In this example, we use quimb's "
"matrix-product state (MPS) simulator, and we use "
"[JAX](https://docs.jax.dev/en/latest/) for automatic differentiation. See "
"the [API "
"documentation](../stubs/qiskit_addon_aqc_tensor.simulation.quimb.QuimbSimulator.rst)"
" for more information on how to use the quimb simulator.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sini, kita menggunakan simulator rangkaian tensor berasaskan "
"[quimb](http://quimb.readthedocs.io/). Dalam contoh ini, kita menggunakan "
"simulator keadaan produk matriks (MPS) quimb, dan kita menggunakan "
"[JAX](https://docs.jax.dev/en/latest/) untuk pembezaan automatik. Lihat "
"[dokumentasi "
"API](../stubs/qiskit_addon_aqc_tensor.simulation.quimb.QuimbSimulator.rst) "
"untuk maklumat lanjut tentang cara menggunakan simulator quimb.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Construct matrix-product state representation of the AQC target state "
"{#construct-matrix-product-state-representation-of-the-aqc-target-state}"
msgstr ""
"Bina perwakilan keadaan produk matriks untuk keadaan sasaran AQC "
"{#construct-matrix-product-state-representation-of-the-aqc-target-state}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, we build a matrix-product representation of the state to be "
"approximated by AQC.\n"
msgstr ""
"Seterusnya, kita bina perwakilan produk matriks bagi keadaan yang hendak "
"dihampiri oleh AQC.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that because we chose a generous number of Trotter steps for the target"
" state, it actually has less Trotter error than the comparison circuit.  We "
"can calculate the fidelity ($| \\langle \\psi_1 | \\psi_2 \\rangle |^2$) of "
"the state prepared by the comparison circuit vs. the target state:\n"
msgstr ""
"Perhatikan bahawa oleh kerana kita memilih bilangan langkah Trotter yang "
"banyak untuk keadaan sasaran, ia sebenarnya mempunyai ralat Trotter yang "
"lebih kecil berbanding Circuit perbandingan. Kita boleh mengira kesetiaan "
"($| \\langle \\psi_1 | \\psi_2 \\rangle |^2$) bagi keadaan yang disediakan "
"oleh Circuit perbandingan berbanding keadaan sasaran:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Optimize the parameters of the ansatz using MPS calculations {#optimize-the-"
"parameters-of-the-ansatz-using-mps-calculations}"
msgstr ""
"Optimumkan parameter ansatz menggunakan pengiraan MPS {#optimize-the-"
"parameters-of-the-ansatz-using-mps-calculations}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here, we minimize the simplest possible cost function, "
"`MaximizeStateFidelity`, by using the L-BFGS optimizer from scipy.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sini, kita meminimumkan fungsi kos paling mudah, `MaximizeStateFidelity`,"
" dengan menggunakan pengoptimum L-BFGS dari scipy.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We choose a stopping point for the fidelity such that it will be above what "
"the comparison circuit would have been, without using AQC.  Once this is "
"reached, the compressed circuit has less Trotter error _and_ less depth than"
" the original circuit.  Given more processing time, further optimization "
"steps can be performed to bring the fidelity even higher.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita pilih titik henti untuk kesetiaan supaya ia akan berada di atas apa "
"yang dimiliki Circuit perbandingan tanpa menggunakan AQC. Setelah ini "
"dicapai, Circuit yang dimampatkan mempunyai ralat Trotter yang lebih kecil "
"_dan_ kedalaman yang lebih rendah berbanding Circuit asal. Dengan lebih "
"banyak masa pemprosesan, langkah pengoptimuman lanjut boleh dilakukan untuk "
"meningkatkan kesetiaan lebih tinggi lagi.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Construct the final circuit to pass to the transpiler {#construct-the-final-"
"circuit-to-pass-to-the-transpiler}"
msgstr ""
"Bina Circuit akhir untuk dihantar ke Transpiler {#construct-the-final-"
"circuit-to-pass-to-the-transpiler}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/aqc-tensor/01-initial-state-"
"aqc/output_2.png)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Gambar rajah Circuit kuantum](/img/qiskit-addons/aqc-tensor/01-initial-"
"state-aqc/output_2.png)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 2: Transpile for execution on target hardware {#step-2-transpile-for-"
"execution-on-target-hardware}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 2: Transpile untuk pelaksanaan pada perkakasan sasaran "
"{#step-2-transpile-for-execution-on-target-hardware}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In Step 2 of a [Qiskit "
"pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns), we  "
"transpile this circuit and any desired observable(s) for execution on a "
"target device.  Here we are using a fake backend provided by `qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dalam Langkah 2 sebuah [corak "
"Qiskit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns), kita "
"men-transpile Circuit ini dan mana-mana observable yang dikehendaki untuk "
"pelaksanaan pada peranti sasaran. Di sini kita menggunakan Backend palsu "
"yang disediakan oleh `qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The resulting ISA circuit can then be sent for execution on the backend "
"(step 3 of a [Qiskit "
"pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns)).\n"
msgstr ""
"Circuit ISA yang terhasil kemudiannya boleh dihantar untuk pelaksanaan pada "
"Backend (langkah 3 sebuah [corak "
"Qiskit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns)).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 3: Execute on quantum hardware {#step-3-execute-on-quantum-hardware}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 3: Jalankan pada perkakasan kuantum {#step-3-execute-on-quantum-"
"hardware}"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Reconstruct {#step-4-reconstruct}"
msgstr "Langkah 4: Bina Semula {#step-4-reconstruct}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Reconstruction is not necessary in our case.  We can just look at the "
"result.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pembinaan semula tidak diperlukan dalam kes kita. Kita boleh terus melihat "
"keputusannya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
msgstr "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
